 "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:02.490142+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:02.490142+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T16:42:02.490142+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_4"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/68ced064-8233-4da9-a33e-7b214b56f19e", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "68ced064-8233-4da9-a33e-7b214b56f19e", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"68ced064-8233-4da9-a33e-7b214b56f19e\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/68ced064-8233-4da9-a33e-7b214b56f19e\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции вида <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+a\"></span>. Най­ди­те зна­че­ние <i>x</i>, при ко­то­ром <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=-0{,}04\"></span>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">48</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет вер­ти­каль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>x</i>  =  −2, зна­чит, <i>a</i>  =  2. По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(−3)  =  2, тогда  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{k}{-3+2}=2\\iff k=-2\"></span>.  Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{-2}{x+2}=-0{,}04\\iff 0{,}04x=1{,}92\\iff x=48\"></span>. </p><